    <!-- About Section -->
    <section id="about" class="about-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <div class="about-content">
          <div class="about-text">
            <p class="intro">How I became a programmer?</p>
            <p>
              Since I was a little child, I wanted to become an astronomer. I
              couldn't even imagine any other profession for myself. I got my
              first telescope in the early years of elementary school and
              started to specialize in maths and physics in high school. At the
              university, I continued to study physics and specialized in
              astronomy. Turned out astronomers code... a lot! At the beginning
              I started with simple Python routines, which eventually grew
              bigger and more complex throughout the years. Towards the end of
              my studies, I was recommended to one of Hungary's most successful
              companies as a programmer. Since then I learned C#, .NET, and now
              I'm learning web development.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
